    "name": "Fiserv BankingHub 3-D Secure Payments API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Fiserv BankingHub API provides RESTful access to core banking operations including account management, transactions, transfers, payments, and party (customer) management. BankingHub enables financial institutions and fintech partners to integrate account opening, fund transfers, payment processing, and customer data management into their applications.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Fiserv Developer Support",
